# 2026-09-18 — the Firebase SERVER key: a private key with full access to the
# project, able to send a notification to every phone. It is never committed;
# it is placed on the VPS by hand at
# /var/www/kelete-fuel/backend/firebase-service-account.json
# and services/push.js quietly disables push when it is missing.
#
# frontend/firebase/google-services.json is a different thing and IS committed:
# it is client config that ships inside every APK and can send nothing.
backend/firebase-service-account.json
frontend/apk-release/
